 "description": "SUMMARY: the paused editor preview now renders the gyro-stabilized\nframe and MP4 export applies the same warp at full resolution, with\ntier gating that mirrors temporal NR exactly.\n\nC++ seam (jni_bridge.cpp): thread_local path-keyed GyroArtifacts cache\n(mirrors the gLut pattern) parses the .gcsv once per path, applies the\nIMU axis remap to every gyro AND accel sample, and runs\nestimateOrientationVqf. resolveStabilization returns false ONLY on\nparse failure; a null/empty path or IoError degrades to no-warp, never\na crash. stabilizationFrameFor syncs from frame-0 anchors\n(frameInfo(0).recvdMs vs gyro imu.logStartWallMs vs first.ptsUs*1000)\nand composes the trim offset: an anchored verdict is kept with its\ntrimOffsetMs, an unanchored clip with trim falls back to\nmanualOffsetMs with offsetKnown=true, otherwise offsetKnown=false.\ncomputeStabilization runs with assumedFocal=true when the conta",
